{'symbol': 'VICI', 'date': '2019-10-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'VICI PROPERTIES INC. REVISES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'VICI PROPERTIES INC. REVISED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019. THE COMPANY ESTIMATES THAT NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019 WILL BE BETWEEN $600.0 MILLION AND $606.0 MILLION, OR BETWEEN $1.37 AND $1.38 PER DILUTED SHARE COMPARED TO $605.0 MILLION AND $615.0 MILLION, OR BETWEEN $1.38 AND $1.40 PER DILUTED SHARE EXPECTED PREVIOUSLY.'}